  "details": "- The world with a capacity of 1 has been exceptionally treated as having a Maximum Capacity of 1, not 2.\n\n- Currently, such worlds are displayed with a Maximum Capacity of 2 on the Web (\"Capacity 2\") and on the VRChat search screen (\"0/2\").\n\n- However, when entering the instance of such worlds, the population is displayed as 1/1, so it keeps the original behaviour.\n\n- By manually setting the Maximum Capacity to 1 on the Web, it is now correctly displayed as Maximum Capacity 1 in searches.\n\nRepro: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_5e91c31e-371a-4ed6-a3d7-a98374068ff3 (I fixed my worlds so this is not mine)",
